#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:45
msgid ""
"This effect/filter animates the input image for a smooth and controlled "
"oscillation. It is similar to :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"motion/camerashake` but by far not as shaky and erratic."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter animuje vstupný obraz na plynulé a kontrolované kmitanie. "
"Podobá sa :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/camerashake`, ale "
"ani zďaleka nie je taký trasľavý a nevyspytateľný."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:49
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:56
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:57
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:59
msgid "X Movement"
msgstr "Pohyb X"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:60
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:63
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:66
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:69
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:72
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:75
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:78
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:81
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Reálne číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:61
msgid ""
"Maximum horizontal displacement. Goes into both directions with 0.5 being "
"centered (no movement)."
msgstr ""
"Maximálne vodorovné posunutie. Ide do oboch smerov, pričom 0,5 je stred (bez "
"pohybu)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:62
msgid "X Speed"
msgstr "Rýchlosť X"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:64
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:70
msgid "Speed of the horizontal movement."
msgstr "Rýchlosť vodorovného pohybu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:65
msgid "Y Movement"
msgstr "Pohyb Y"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:67
msgid ""
"Maximum vertical displacement. Goes into both directions with 0.5 being "
"centered (no movement)."
msgstr ""
"Maximálne zvislé posunutie. Ide do oboch smerov, pričom 0,5 je stred (bez "
"pohybu)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:68
msgid "Y Speed"
msgstr "Rýchlosť Y"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:71
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "Otočenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:73
msgid ""
"Maximum rotation. Goes into both directions with 0.5 being centered (no "
"rotation)"
msgstr ""
"Maximálne otočenie. Ide do oboch smerov, pričom 0,5 je stred (bez otočenia)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:74
msgid "Rotation Speed"
msgstr "Rýchlosť otáčania"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:76
msgid "Speed of the rotation"
msgstr "Rýchlosť otáčania"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:77
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "Mierka"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:79
msgid ""
"Zoom factor to hide black borders. Only useful if mirrored is off and you "
"want to prevent black borders or other clips to show when moving or rotating "
"out of bounds."
msgstr ""
"Faktor priblíženia na skrytie čiernych okrajov. Užitočné iba vtedy, keď je "
"zrkadlenie vypnuté a chcete zabrániť zobrazeniu čiernych okrajov alebo iných "
"klipov pri pohybe alebo otočení mimo hraníc."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:80
msgid "Phase"
msgstr "Fáza"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:82
msgid "Entry points into the sine and cosine functions."
msgstr "Vstupné body do funkcií sínus a kosínus."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:83
msgid "Mirrored"
msgstr "Zrkadlené"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:84
msgid "Switch"
msgstr "Prepínač"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:85
msgid ""
"If selected, mirrors the image if movement or rotation moves it out of "
"bounds. Only useful if scaling is not used and you want to prevent black "
"borders or other clips to show."
msgstr ""
"Ak je vybrané, zrkadlí obraz, keď ho pohyb alebo otočenie posunie mimo "
"hraníc. Užitočné iba vtedy, keď sa nepoužíva zmena mierky a chcete zabrániť "
"zobrazeniu čiernych okrajov alebo iných klipov."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/shake0scillate.rst:89
msgid "Using motion blur slows down the shake effect significantly."
msgstr "Použitie rozmazania pohybom výrazne spomaľuje efekt trasenia."
